      "content": "that's a good start, thanks. it's definitely easy to read. \n\ncould we expand on that with a little more detail? specifically, we need to mention something about \"sodium intake\" and \"lifestyle changes\" like light exercise. i'm worried if we use too many big words for the medical stuff the readability score will tank.\n\ncan you try a longer version? maybe two or three paragraphs? just remember: keep the medical stuff accurate, but try to keep that simplicity score high so it stays easy for the seniors to follow.",
